  "fields": {
    "name": "PgSharding shared shard-set configuration view",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "PgSharding accepts provider-specific PostgreSQL shard-set configurations through PgShardConnectionOptions.PgShardSets. Consumers of the shared sharding contract obtain that same collection through IShardSetsConfigurationOptions.ShardSetsConfigInternal as IShardSetConnectionsConfiguration entries; each returned entry preserves its shard-set identity, default shard identifier, shard collection, and optional read/write configuration views."
  },
